OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FA former butcher has been told he may
OL,7,Fdie behind bars after he murdered a
OL,8,Fman and tried to dispose of his body
OL,9,Fin a barrel.
OL,11,FChristopher Wright has been jailed for
OL,12,Flife after he murdered Richard Dyson
OL,13,Fand dismembered his body, which he
OL,14,Ftried to conceal in a concrete-filled
OL,15,Fbarrel on a farm in Barnsley, South
OL,16,FYorkshire.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/8
