CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786310307
OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FThe whereabouts of 55-year-old Mr
OL,7,FDyson remained unknown for nearly six
OL,8,Fyears following the murder in 2019,
OL,9,Fbefore his remains were eventually
OL,10,Fdiscovered concealed in a barrel on a
OL,11,Ftrailer.
OL,13,FHe was reported missing in November
OL,14,F2019 by his daughter, Bethany Dainty.
OL,16,FSheffield Crown Court heard Mr Dyson
OL,17,Fhad been living in a car on Wright's
OL,18,Ffarm and was doing odd jobs for him,
OL,19,Fbefore the pair fell out when Wright
OL,20,Faccused him of stealing and selling
OL,21,Fhis possessions.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786310307
OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FWright, an antique firearms collector,
OL,7,Fshot Mr Dyson in the arm and chest,
OL,8,Fbefore dismembering his body and
OL,9,Fplacing him inside the blue barrel
OL,10,Fwhich he filled with cement from a
OL,11,Fbuilder's merchant.
OL,13,FHe then left the barrel in a trailer
OL,14,Fwhich was stored with an unwitting and
OL,15,Finnocent neighbour.
OL,17,FWright also roped in childhood friend
OL,18,FKarl Schwalbe, 72, to help conceal the
OL,19,Fcrime.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786310307
OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FThe 73-year-old was jailed for life
OL,7,Fwith a minimum of 35 years on
OL,8,FThursday, as a judge at Sheffield
OL,9,FCrown Court told him he would likely
OL,10,Fdie in jail.
OL,12,FSchwalbe was also convicted of
OL,13,Fconspiring to pervert the course of
OL,14,Fjustice and jailed for three years.
OL,16,FMr Justice Cotter, sitting at
OL,17,FSheffield Crown Court, said Wright
OL,18,Fmust serve life with a minimum term of
OL,19,F35 years less time on remand, and was
OL,20,Flikely to die in prison.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
