FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786310307
OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FSpeaking of what Wright did to his
OL,7,Fvictim, the judge said: "You had
OL,8,Fworked as a butcher and were skilled
OL,9,Fenough to do such a terrible thing,
OL,10,Fsomething few ordinary people would
OL,11,Fhave the stomach for."
OL,13,FIn her victim's statement, Mr Dyson's
OL,14,Fdaughter Bethany Dainty spoke of not
OL,15,Fknowing what had happened to her
OL,16,Ffather for so long.
OL,18,FShe said: "I couldn't grieve because I
OL,19,Fdid not know the truth."
OL,26,@oD@YOUsD@VO]zD@KOU{D@XO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786310307
OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FAfter they were questioned by
OL,7,Fdetectives on one occasion, Wright and
OL,8,FSchwalbe were recorded by cameras in a
OL,9,Fpolice car park discussing CCTV that
OL,10,Fofficers had gathered.
OL,12,FAnd when police were searching his
OL,13,Fproperty, Wright was filmed in a hotel
OL,14,Fpraying for absolution from God and
OL,15,Fthat his weapons would not be found.
OL,17,FChristopher Dunn, for Schwalbe, said
OL,18,Fit was "an error of Biblical
OL,19,Fproportions" not to tell the police
OL,20,Fwhat happened.
OL,26,@zD@HOU{D@LO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
