PN,33607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786310307
OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FWright was convicted of murder,
OL,7,Fconspiracy to pervert the course of
OL,8,Fjustice, preventing a lawful burial as
OL,9,Fwell as firearms offences.
OL,11,FSpeaking outside court, Detective
OL,12,FChief Inspector Andy Knowles praised
OL,13,FMr Dyson's loved ones and said the
OL,14,Finvestigation had been "long, complex
OL,15,Fand emotionally draining".
OL,26,@vD@XOUwD@YO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/8
