OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786310307
OL,3,CFarmer jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Cman whose body he hid inside barrel
OL,6,FHe said: "Wright and Schwalbe knew
OL,7,Fwhat happened to Richard and even with
OL,8,Fthe evidence against them, they
OL,9,Fcontinued to deny accountability,
OL,10,Fmaking Richard's family endure a
OL,11,Ftrial, listen to harrowing evidence
OL,12,Fand distressing testimonies.
OL,14,F"The strength and dignity in
OL,15,Fconfronting each moment of this
OL,16,Fprocess has been nothing short of
OL,17,Fextraordinary."
OL,26,@nD@JOUvD@AOUyD@OO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/8
